# No personal data

- Never commit real names, phones, emails, addresses, or other PII in seeds, fixtures, tests, comments, or screenshots.
- Use obviously fake data (`user@example.com`, `+972-50-0000000`, "Test User").
- Sentry must keep `sendDefaultPii: false` and the shared PII scrubber.
- See `docs/adr/0007-no-personal-data-in-repo.md`.
